Origin
------

This package was extracted from LeRobot's steerable annotation pipeline and
then extended. Files that carry a "Copyright ... The HuggingFace Inc. team"
header are derived from LeRobot and retain that notice, as the Apache License
requires. The prompt templates under `src/lerobot_align/prompts/` that are
shared with upstream are byte-identical to it; the evaluation study under
`evaluation/` verifies this before every run.

Work added by this project includes the given-subtask alignment path, native
video encoding, motion-adaptive and stacked-multiview frame sampling, the
dynamic-programming boundary calibration, the subtask import sources, and the
evaluation harness under `evaluation/`.

